I tried implementing in the browser with WebHID the equivalent of [this code](https://github.com/davdiv/dpvr-e3s-driver/blob/c8aadb76a30a6aa58806e4b1092403078a4710be/src/driver.ts#L71) that works with [node-hid](https://github.com/node-hid/node-hid), but it does not work because of the wrong length (there is no way to specify the length in `receiveFeatureReport`:

```js
  const filters = [{ vendorId: 0x2d49, productId: 0x001b }];
  const device = (await navigator.hid.requestDevice({ filters }))[0];
  await device.open();
  const report = await device.receiveFeatureReport(0x1b); // there is no way to say the length should be 107
```
